docs {
  ## Parent Handbook
  
  Updates parent handbook policy acknowledgments.
  
  ### Path Parameters
  - `school_id` (number, required): School identifier
  - `child_id` (string, required): Child identifier
  
  ### Request Body
  - Multiple agreement fields (string): Policy acknowledgments
  - `parent_sign_handbook` (string, required): Parent signature
  - `parent_sign_date_handbook` (string, required): Signature date
  - `updated_by` (string, required): User making the update
  
  ### Response
  Returns updated parent handbook data with all acknowledgments
  
  ### 2 table joins 
  - parent_handbook_form
  - student_form_repository
}
